@message_testing
title: Message Testing
subtitle: Refine our message for swing voters.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; suburban_dem += 4*(1-dissent); working_dem += 2*(1-dissent); establishment_strength += 2; progressive_dissent += 3

Focus groups reveal what persuadable voters actually care about. The new message is sharper, and some on the left call it focus-grouped mush.

